    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 1 \u00b7 Query Agent  (ask your docs)\nTelegram (text **or** voice) \u2192 transcribe voice with Whisper \u2192 **AI Agent** (Claude) calls the `company_knowledge_base` tool (Supabase/pgvector, topK 6) \u2192 cited answer back to Telegram.\n\nGrounding is enforced in the system prompt: answer only from retrieved context, cite `file_name`, or say it isn't in the docs.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 1160,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "f9a035c2-208a-4e7d-a348-d7f115c9d95b",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -1160,
        -60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 2 \u00b7 Ingest  (index new docs)\nGoogle Drive *file created* \u2192 download \u2192 extract text \u2192 recursive split (1000/150) \u2192 embed (text-embedding-3-small) \u2192 **insert** into Supabase with `file_name` + `drive_id` metadata (metadata powers citations + idempotent re-index).",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 980,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "90cbe338-12da-49a8-9b4d-d30ec2a12b22",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -1160,
        1080
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 3 \u00b7 Idempotent Re-index  (docs change)\nGoogle Drive *file updated* \u2192 **DELETE every chunk WHERE metadata->>drive_id = fileId** \u2192 re-extract \u2192 re-embed \u2192 re-insert. Delete-then-insert keyed on `drive_id` prevents duplicate/stale chunks \u2014 the senior detail that keeps answers correct over time.",
        "height": 280,
        "width": 1160,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "fc872000-d458-461c-937b-29b978f77cc5",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -1160,
        1900
      ]
    }
  ],
